// The production-minded backend starter: a workspace of three packages.
//
//   Packages/Contract  the wire contract, a library the other two share
//   Packages/Service   the deployable HTTP service, on the first-party
//                      `backend` battery
//   Packages/Client    a client of that service
//
// A change to the contract reaches both programs at their next build. The
// service takes its address, state directory and operator credential from the
// environment, applies only additive migrations, prints `ready` once it
// listens and drains in-flight requests when it is interrupted.
workspace: module {
    members: find("./Packages")
}
